<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Demande envoyée – WeCare</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  {{ include('landing/_styles.html.twig') }}
  <style>
    body { background: #F1FAF9; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; }
    .confirm-wrap {
      flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
    .confirm-card {
      background: #fff; border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1.5px solid #e0edf5;
      padding: 56px 48px; text-align: center;
      max-width: 480px; width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(12,0,82,0.06);
    }
    .confirm-icon {
      width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(14,168,153,0.12);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }
    .confirm-card h1 {
      font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0c0052;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .confirm-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem; color: #8a85b0; line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .confirm-btn {
      display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px;
      background: #0ea899; color: #fff;
      border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .confirm-btn:hover { background: #0db8a6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
{{ include('landing/_nav.html.twig') }}

<div class="confirm-wrap">
  <div class="confirm-card">
    <div class="confirm-icon">
      <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#0ea899" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Demande envoyée !</h1>
    <p>Merci pour votre intérêt. Notre équipe a bien reçu votre demande et vous recontactera sous 24h.</p>
    <a href="{{ path('landing_home') }}" class="confirm-btn">Retour à l'accueil</a>
  </div>
</div>

{{ include('landing/_footer.html.twig') }}
</body>
</html>
